{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaur Fossil Hunter: Prologue</strong> is a beginning of the full game. Play as a paleontologist, exploring different lands and searching for dinosaur fossils. The Prologue tells a story about young Paleontology enthusiast and his passionate pursuit of success and self-determination. The story inspires you to face challenges head-on and achieve your fulfilling goals despite various hardships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339460/extras/0d7616e0d70bb0e1a464768e86bbf221.poster.avif?t=1728555534\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339460/extras/0d7616e0d70bb0e1a464768e86bbf221.webm?t=1728555534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339460/extras/0d7616e0d70bb0e1a464768e86bbf221.mp4?t=1728555534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prologue features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- autosave system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- off road vehicle and deformable terrain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- minimap available while driving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- various exploration &amp; excavation tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- detailed dinosaur skeleton models</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ability to rotate the skeleton during assembly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- bone cleaning stages &amp; fossil preparation tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- location inspired by US landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- immersive storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- dinosaur showcase &amp; museum design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339460/extras/4dd4c09e6cdcbb2240183f0c6a070f56.avif?t=1728555534\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339460/extras/edb0161b9db9f6489684d466613502c3.webp?t=1728555534\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4ae4936da733cc2e4ac1aeab7d75a35af9495f59.jpg","localized_name":"Daddy, I drew a dino!","name":"Daddy, I drew a dino!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1339460/4ae4936da733cc2e4ac1aeab7d75a35af9495f59.jpg"},{"icon":"ef1810ef632d6151bb7405995142df2877ed7799.jpg","localized_name":"Woodwork addicted","name":"Woodwork addicted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1339460/ef1810ef632d6151bb7405995142df2877ed7799.jpg"},{"icon":"27cbcdaddd15408c55f507498efaa9f2c9c0b3e2.jpg","localized_name":"Truly passionate","name":"Truly passionate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1339460/27cbcdaddd15408c55f507498efaa9f2c9c0b3e2.jpg"},{"icon":"2e904e59b31bd2469199e603f0b2947839067814.jpg","localized_name":"Never ending exploration","name":"Never ending exploration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1339460/2e904e59b31bd2469199e603f0b2947839067814.jpg"},{"icon":"6d0671759635d9c1a7a5cb50c3399ad119c78135.jpg","localized_name":"Searching like a boss","name":"Searching like a boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1339460/6d0671759635d9c1a7a5cb50c3399ad119c78135.jpg"},{"icon":"bea2fe4c993fc0d4a7fb2777019fae44c7846a34.jpg","localized_name":"Patience you must have","name":"Patience you must have","path":"ht